null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,4512103,4512815]},"desc":"Hatch it. Feed it. Ride it. Fight it.\nYour dragon lays eggs right in your yard — walk over them to collect, then hatch for one of 9 species, from a common Fire to the legendary Sovereign.\n🧬 GENES — every hatch rolls HP / ATK / EGG genes from 0 to 6. Two of the same species are never the same dragon. Chase the perfect 18.\n🍖 FEED — keep the trough full and watch it grow through 5 stages: Hatchling → Juvenile → Adult → Elder → Apex.\n⚔️ ARENA — send your dragon out to auto-battle for coins. Two rings running at once, so there's no queue.\n🪽 RIDE — grown winged dragons can be flown. Take off and loot the floating sky islands.\n✨ SCALES — scales glitter across the world and fly off dragons mid-fight. Grab them, fill your satchel, run them home to the Smelter for instant coins.\n🏠 UPGRADE — trough, egg field, stable, satchel, and a second dragon on your plot.\nWalk up to your dragon and press F. It leans into your hand.","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7d70f5440493b294a9c88d76b999aecc/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d10ae4592a35549770efa4a1c0f28a23/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-06fd311fd860c4510ec1dd085b797554/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}